Z||000002||Cliff Pennock||01-21-2000||05:16 PM||||I guess you're getting this error in P.I.P. just after you have pressed the "Get" button trying to retrieve the profile for this forum?<P>This usually means you're using an old version of Internet Explorer (both PIP and IE use the same Windows library). You probably need newer versions of these libraries. Unfortunately, Microsoft does not allow us programmers to re-distribute these libraries together with our products, and Microsoft does not offer a way to only update these libraries. So I'm afraid the only way to solve this is to install Internet Explorer 4.0 or a higher version...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
